  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Support to Increase Resilience to Natural Disasters in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK support will build resilience in Nepal by strengthening national systems for disaster risk management and response, increasing community-based earthquake readiness and improving preparedness for a national and international emergency response.</narrative>
  </description>
